{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Hey, come on in. How are you two holding up?",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): We're fine. I told him this was gonna be a waste of your time.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Uh, the parking garage ate like twenty minutes. Sorry we're late.",
  "[SEG0004] person_1 (DOCTOR): You're here, that's what counts. What's been on your mind?",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (PATIENT): It's just my legs. They get this creepy crawly feeling at night. Not a big deal.",
  "[SEG0006] person_1 (DOCTOR): Creepy crawly, like you have to move them?",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah, like bugs under the skin. I shift around and it eases off. I'm not suffering.",
  "[SEG0008] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She gets out of bed and paces the hallway. It's not nothing.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): How long's this been going on?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): umm, two weeks. No, wait, five weeks. It started when I hit twenty-five weeks.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (DOCTOR): And how's your sleep been with all that?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Sleep is fine. I get plenty.",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): That is not true. She's up for hours. Some nights she gets three hours, maybe four.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): He's dramatic. I'm thirty weeks, everybody sleeps weird.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): Ok. Any fever lately?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any cough, or trouble catching your breath?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): Nope. Breathing's fine.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): What about headaches, or any change in your vision?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): um not really headaches. My eyes go a little fuzzy when I'm wiped out, then it clears. It's nothing.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (DOCTOR): Alright. What are you taking for the pregnancy?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): Folic acid, eight hundred micrograms, every morning. And iron, err, sixty-five milligrams.",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (PATIENT): Wait, no. I looked at the bottle in the car. It's feros sulfate, three hundred twenty-five milligrams, once a day.",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She skips it. A couple days a week it just sits on the counter.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): I take it most days. It's not that serious. And I don't smoke, I never have, so don't start on that.",
  "[SEG0026] person_1 (DOCTOR): The skipping does matter. Your ferritin came back at eleven, and we never pinned down the date, sometime in the last month I think, the chart's a little vague on my end too.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): They said it was low. I don't remember a number, and I sure don't remember the day.",
  "[SEG0028] person_1 (DOCTOR): Eleven is low for where you are. Let me look at your legs a second. No pitting swelling, calves are soft, not red, not warm.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (DOCTOR): Pressure today is one-eighteen over seventy-two, and your pulse is eighty-six.",
  "[SEG0030] person_1 (DOCTOR): This sounds like restless legs. Really common at thirty weeks when the iron stores are down. That's my working impression, not something I can stamp as final today.",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): So it's just a pregnancy thing. I figured.",
  "[SEG0032] person_1 (DOCTOR): A lot of it, yes. I still want a fresh ferritin. I'll order that draw with your midwife visit.",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): She's already booked Thursday, at the birth center, ten in the morning.",
  "[SEG0034] person_1 (DOCTOR): Perfect, we'll keep that Thursday visit, and the ferritin goes with it. Keep taking the ferrous sulfate every day, by mouth, with a little orange juice, not with your calcium.",
  "[SEG0035] person_2 (PATIENT): Orange juice, got it. If I remember.",
  "[SEG0036] person_1 (DOCTOR): If you get bleeding, contractions that won't quit, a bad headache, or the fuzzy vision sticks around, don't wait for Thursday, go to labor and delivery.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah yeah. I'm not gonna panic over fuzzy eyes.",
  "[SEG0038] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): I'll make sure she actually goes Thursday.",
  "[SEG0039] person_1 (DOCTOR): Right. You're doing fine. We'll see what that ferritin says and go from there."
 ],
